WEBVTT

00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:02.900
Every healer starts as a curious kid.

00:00:03.150 --> 00:00:06.700
At Arkcov Academy, middle and high school cadets train in real medicine,

00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:11.200
with physician mentors, hands-on labs, and stories that bring science to life.

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:15.900
Train. Heal. Discover. Inspire.

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:18.650
Your mission begins here.
